    (37, 'ultra-sun', 'Its beautiful tails have made it very popular. However, if it''s not brushed diligently, it will be a mass of tangles before you know it.'),
    (37, 'white', 'It controls balls of fire. As it grows, its six tails split from their tips to make more tails.'),
    (37, 'white-2', 'As each tail grows, its fur becomes more lustrous. When held, it feels slightly warm.'),
    (37, 'x', 'When it is born, it has just one snow-white tail. The tail splits from its tip as it grows older.'),
    (37, 'y', 'While young, it has six gorgeous tails. When it grows, several new tails are sprouted.'),
    (37, 'yellow', 'Both its fur and its tails are beautiful. As it grows, the tails split and form more tails.'),
    (38, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Legend has it that Ninetales came into being when nine wizards possessing sacred powers merged into one. This Pokémon is highly intelligent—it can understand human speech.'),
    (38, 'black', 'Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years.'),
    (38, 'black-2', 'Each of its nine tails is imbued with supernatural power, and it can live for a thousand years.'),
    (38, 'blue', 'Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1000-year curse.'),
    (38, 'crystal', 'It is said to live a thousand years, and each of its tails is loaded with supernatural powers.'),
    (38, 'diamond', 'Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years.'),
    (38, 'emerald', 'It has long been said that each of the nine tails embody an enchanted power. A long-lived Ninetales will have fur that shines like gold.'),
    (38, 'firered', 'It has nine long tails and fur that gleams gold. It is said to live for 1,000 years.'),
    (38, 'gold', 'Some legends claim that each of its nine tails has its own unique type of special mystical power.'),
    (38, 'heartgold', 'Some legends claim that each of its nine tails has its own unique type of special mystical power.'),
    (38, 'leafgreen', 'Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1,000-year curse.'),
    (38, 'moon', 'Said to live for a thousand years, this Pokémon uses its supernatural abilities to manipulate fire. It can burn its prey to a crisp as it pleases.'),
    (38, 'omega-ruby', 'Ninetales casts a sinister light from its bright red eyes to gain total control over its foe''s mind. This Pokémon is said to live for a thousand years.'),
    (38, 'pearl', 'Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years.'),
    (38, 'platinum', 'Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years.'),
    (38, 'red', 'Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1000-year curse.'),
    (38, 'ruby', 'Ninetales casts a sinister light from its bright red eyes to gain total control over its foe''s mind. This {{ScPkmn}} is said to live for a thousand years.'),
    (38, 'sapphire', 'Legend has it that Ninetales came into being when nine wizards possessing sacred powers merged into one. This {{ScPkmn}} is highly intelligent - it can understand human speech.'),
    (38, 'silver', 'Its nine beautiful tails are filled with a wondrous energy that could keep it alive for 1,000 years.'),
    (38, 'soulsilver', 'Its nine beautiful tails are filled with a wondrous energy that could keep it alive for 1,000 years.'),
    (38, 'sun', 'Legend has it that this mystical Pokémon was formed when nine saints coalesced into one.'),
    (38, 'ultra-moon', 'The flickering flames it spews from its mouth leave its opponents hypnotized. Then, this extremely intelligent Pokémon attacks.'),
    (38, 'ultra-sun', 'It is vindictive and relentless by nature. Those who cross it even once will be cursed for a thousand years, along with their descendants.'),
    (38, 'white', 'Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years.'),
    (38, 'white-2', 'Each of its nine tails is imbued with supernatural power, and it can live for a thousand years.'),
