    (38, 'y', 'Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1,000-year curse.'),
    (38, 'yellow', 'According to an enduring legend, 9 noble saints were united and reincarnated as this {{ScPkmn}}.'),
    (39, 'alpha-sapphire', 'When this Pokémon sings, it never pauses to breathe. If it is in a battle against an opponent that does not easily fall asleep, Jigglypuff cannot breathe, endangering its life.'),
    (39, 'black', 'When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.'),
    (39, 'black-2', 'Looking into its cute, round eyes makes it start singing a song so pleasant listeners can''t help but fall asleep.'),
    (39, 'blue', 'When its huge eyes light up, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to {{status|sleep}}.'),
    (39, 'brilliant-diamond', 'When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.'),
    (39, 'crystal', 'It rolls its cute eyes as it sings a soothing lullaby. Its gentle song puts anyone who hears it to sleep.'),
    (39, 'diamond', 'When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.'),
    (39, 'emerald', 'Nothing can avoid falling asleep hearing a Jigglypuff''s song. The sound waves of its singing voice match the brain waves of someone in a deep sleep.'),
    (39, 'firered', 'It captivates foes with its huge, round eyes, then lulls them to sleep by singing a soothing melody.'),
    (39, 'gold', 'If it inflates to Sing a lullaby, it can perform longer and cause sure drowsiness in its audience.'),
