    (41, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Zubat avoids sunlight because exposure causes it to become unhealthy. During the daytime, it stays in caves or under the eaves of old houses, sleeping while hanging upside down.'),
    (41, 'black', 'It checks its surroundings and location using reflections of the ultrasonic waves from its mouth.'),
    (41, 'black-2', 'It does not need eyes, because it emits ultrasonic waves to check its surroundings while it flies.'),
    (41, 'blue', 'Forms colonies in perpetually dark places. Uses ultrasonic waves to identify and approach targets.'),
    (41, 'brilliant-diamond', 'Even though it has no eyes, it can sense obstacles using ultrasonic waves it emits from its mouth.'),
    (41, 'crystal', 'During the day, it gathers with others and hangs from the ceilings of old buildings and caves.'),
    (41, 'diamond', 'Even though it has no eyes, it can sense obstacles using ultrasonic waves it emits from its mouth.'),
    (41, 'emerald', 'While living in pitch-black caverns, their eyes gradually grew shut and deprived them of vision. They use ultrasonic waves to detect obstacles.'),
    (41, 'firered', 'It has no eyes. Instead, it relies on its ultrasonic cries for echo location to flit about in darkness.'),
    (41, 'gold', 'While flying, it constantly emits ultrasonic waves from its mouth to check its surroundings.'),
    (41, 'heartgold', 'While flying, it constantly emits ultrasonic waves from its mouth to check its surroundings.'),
    (41, 'leafgreen', 'It forms colonies in perpetually dark places and uses ultrasonic waves to identify and approach targets.'),
    (41, 'legends-arceus', 'Makes its home in gloomy caves. Atrophied eyes have left this Pokémon blind, so it scans its surroundings via sound waves that it emits from its mouth as it flies.'),
    (41, 'legends-za', 'It sleeps in caves during the day. It has no eyes, so it emits ultrasonic waves to check its surroundings while flying.'),
    (41, 'moon', 'When exposed to sunlight, they suffer burns. The frequency of their ultrasonic waves can differ slightly from colony to colony.'),
    (41, 'omega-ruby', 'Zubat remains quietly unmoving in a dark spot during the bright daylight hours. It does so because prolonged exposure to the sun causes its body to become slightly burned.'),
    (41, 'pearl', 'Disliking sunlight, it sleeps deep in forests and caves until sundown.'),
    (41, 'platinum', 'It checks its surroundings and location using reflections of the ultrasonic waves from its mouth.'),
    (41, 'red', 'Forms colonies in perpetually dark places. Uses ultrasonic waves to identify and approach targets.'),
