    (41, 'sapphire', 'Zubat avoids sunlight because exposure causes it to become unhealthy. During the daytime, it stays in caves or under the eaves of old houses, sleeping while hanging upside down.'),
    (41, 'shield', 'Zubat live in caves, down where the sun''s light won''t reach. In the morning, they gather together to keep each other warm as they sleep.'),
    (41, 'shining-pearl', 'Disliking sunlight, it sleeps deep in forests and caves until sundown.'),
    (41, 'silver', 'Capable of flying safely in dark places, it emits ultrasonic cries to check for any obstacles.'),
    (41, 'soulsilver', 'Capable of flying safely in dark places, it emits ultrasonic cries to check for any obstacles.'),
    (41, 'sun', 'It sleeps in caves during the day. It has no eyes, so to check its surroundings while flying, it emits ultrasonic waves.'),
    (41, 'sword', 'It emits ultrasonic waves from its mouth to check its surroundings. Even in tight caves, Zubat flies around with skill.'),
    (41, 'ultra-moon', 'Their skin is so thin that they''ll be burned if sunlight hits them. When it gets cold out, they gather together to warm one another''s bodies.'),
    (41, 'ultra-sun', 'It has no eyeballs, so it can''t see. It checks its surroundings via the ultrasonic waves it emits from its mouth.'),
    (41, 'white', 'It checks its surroundings and location using reflections of the ultrasonic waves from its mouth.'),
    (41, 'white-2', 'It does not need eyes, because it emits ultrasonic waves to check its surroundings while it flies.'),
    (41, 'x', 'Even though it has no eyes, it can sense obstacles using ultrasonic waves it emits from its mouth.'),
    (41, 'y', 'It has no eyes. Instead, it relies on its ultrasonic cries for echolocation to flit about in darkness.'),
