    (43, 'black-2', 'It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.'),
    (43, 'blue', 'During the day, it keeps its face buried in the ground. At night, it wanders around sowing its seeds.'),
    (43, 'brilliant-diamond', 'It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.'),
    (43, 'crystal', 'During the day, it stays in the cold underground to avoid the sun. It grows by bathing in moonlight.'),
    (43, 'diamond', 'It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.'),
    (43, 'emerald', 'This {{ScPkmn}} grows by absorbing moonlight. During the daytime, it buries itself in the ground, leaving only its leaves exposed to avoid detection by its enemies.'),
