    (46, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Paras has parasitic mushrooms growing on its back called tochukaso. They grow large by drawing nutrients from this Bug Pokémon host. They are highly valued as a medicine for extending life. (matches Pokémon Sapphire version 1.0)'),
    (46, 'black', 'Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host Paras.'),
    (46, 'black-2', 'Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host Paras.'),
    (46, 'blue', 'Burrows to suck tree roots. The mushrooms on its back grow by drawing nutrients from the bug host.'),
    (46, 'brilliant-diamond', 'Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host Paras.'),
    (46, 'crystal', 'The tochukaso growing on this {{ScPkmn}}''s back orders it to extract juice from tree trunks.'),
    (46, 'diamond', 'Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host Paras.'),
