    (54, 'alpha-sapphire', 'If it uses its mysterious power, Psyduck can''t remember having done so. It apparently can''t form a memory of such an event because it goes into an altered state that is much like deep sleep.'),
    (54, 'black', 'Overwhelmed by enigmatic abilities, it suffers a constant headache. It sometimes uses mysterious powers.'),
    (54, 'black-2', 'When headaches stimulate its brain cells, which are usually inactive, it can use a mysterious power.'),
    (54, 'blue', 'While lulling its enemies with its vacant look, this wily {{ScPkmn}} will use psychokinetic powers.'),
    (54, 'brilliant-diamond', 'If its usual headache worsens, it starts exhibiting odd powers. It can''t remember doing so, however.'),
