    (56, 'alpha-sapphire', 'When Mankey starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it''s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath.'),
    (56, 'black', 'It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.'),
    (56, 'black-2', 'It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.'),
