    (57, 'alpha-sapphire', 'When Primeape becomes furious, its blood circulation is boosted. In turn, its muscles are made even stronger. However, it also becomes much less intelligent at the same time.'),
    (57, 'black', 'It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.'),
    (57, 'black-2', 'It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.'),
    (57, 'blue', 'Always furious and tenacious to boot. It will not abandon chasing its quarry until it is caught.'),
    (57, 'brilliant-diamond', 'It becomes angry if it sees an opponent''s eyes and gets angrier if the opponent runs. Even after it beats the opponent, it is still angry.'),
    (57, 'crystal', 'It will beat up anyone who makes it mad, even if it has to chase them until the end of the world.'),
