    (64, 'diamond', 'If one is nearby, an eerie shadow appears on TV screens. Seeing the shadow is said to bring bad luck.'),
    (64, 'emerald', 'It is rumored that a boy with psychic abilities suddenly transformed into Kadabra while he was assisting research into extrasensory powers.'),
