    (77, 'diamond', 'About an hour after birth, its fiery mane and tail grow out, giving it an impressive appearance.'),
    (77, 'emerald', 'A Ponyta is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. Its legs become stronger as it stumbles and falls while trying to keep up with its parent.'),
