    (77, 'leafgreen', 'Its hooves are ten times harder than diamond. It can trample anything completely flat in little time.'),
    (77, 'legends-arceus', 'These Pokémon live in herds out in the grassland. Newborn foals lack their fiery manes, which will develop about an hour after birth.'),
