    (77, 'pearl', 'Its legs grow strong while it chases after its parent. It runs in fields and mountains all day.'),
    (77, 'platinum', 'As a newborn, it can barely stand. However, through galloping, its legs are made tougher and faster.'),
    (77, 'red', 'Its hooves are 10 times harder than diamonds. It can trample anything completely flat in little time.'),
