    (81, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Magnemite floats in the air by emitting electromagnetic waves from the units at its sides. These waves block gravity. This Pokémon becomes incapable of flight if its internal electrical supply is depleted.'),
    (81, 'black', 'The faster the units at its sides rotate, the greater the magnetic force they generate.'),
    (81, 'black-2', 'The electromagnetic waves emitted by the units at the sides of its head expel antigravity, which allows it to float.'),
