    (91, 'yellow', 'For protection, it uses its harder-than-diamonds shell. It also shoots spikes from the shell.'),
    (92, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Gastly is largely composed of gaseous matter. When exposed to a strong wind, the gaseous body quickly dwindles away. Groups of this Pokémon cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.'),
