    (93, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Haunter is a dangerous Pokémon. If one beckons you while floating in darkness, you must never approach it. This Pokémon will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.'),
    (93, 'black', 'It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.'),
    (93, 'black-2', 'It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.'),
    (93, 'blue', 'Because of its ability to slip through block walls, it is said to be from another dimension.'),
    (93, 'brilliant-diamond', 'It can slip through any obstacle. It lurks inside walls to keep an eye on its foes.'),
    (93, 'crystal', 'It hides in the dark, planning to take the life of the next living thing that wanders close by.'),
    (93, 'diamond', 'It can slip through any obstacle. It lurks inside walls to keep an eye on its foes.'),
