    (95, 'diamond', 'When it travels underground, it causes rumbling and tremors. It can move at 50 mph.'),
    (95, 'emerald', 'There is a magnet in its brain that prevents an Onix from losing direction while tunneling. As it grows older, its body becomes steadily rounder and smoother.'),
