    (96, 'alpha-sapphire', 'If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it''s a sure sign that one of these Pokémon is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils.'),
    (96, 'black', 'It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.'),
    (96, 'black-2', 'It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.'),
    (96, 'blue', 'Puts enemies to {{status|sleep}} then eats their dreams. Occasionally gets sick from eating bad dreams.'),
