    (96, 'diamond', 'It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.'),
    (96, 'emerald', 'If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it''s a sure sign that a Drowzee is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils.'),
