    (102, 'alpha-sapphire', 'This Pokémon consists of six eggs that form a closely knit cluster. The six eggs attract each other and spin around. When cracks increasingly appear on the eggs, Exeggcute is close to evolution.'),
    (102, 'black', 'Its six eggs converse using telepathy. They can quickly gather if they become separated.'),
    (102, 'black-2', 'Its six eggs converse using telepathy. They can quickly gather if they become separated.'),
