    (105, 'sun', 'Originally, it was weak and timid. After evolution, its temperament becomes violent, and it begins to wield bones as weapons.'),
    (105, 'ultra-moon', 'They thump their bones rhythmically to communicate among themselves. There are nearly 50 different rhythmic patterns.'),
