    (125, 'ultra-sun', 'Electricity permeates its body. It swings its arms round and round to charge up electricity before unleashing a punch.'),
    (125, 'violet', 'Research is progressing on storing lightning in Electabuzz so this energy can be used at any time.'),
    (125, 'white', 'It windmills its arms to slightly boost its punches. Foes have been known to escape in the meantime.'),
    (125, 'white-2', 'Research is progressing on storing lightning in Electabuzz so this energy can be used at any time.'),
    (125, 'x', 'Electricity runs across the surface of its body. In darkness, its entire body glows a whitish blue.'),
    (125, 'y', 'It loves to feed on strong electricity. It occasionally appears around large power plants and so on.'),
    (125, 'yellow', 'If a major power outage occurs, it is certain that this {{ScPkmn}} has eaten electricity at a power plant.'),
    (126, 'alpha-sapphire', 'In battle, Magmar blows out intensely hot flames from all over its body to intimidate its opponent. This Pokémon''s fiery bursts create heat waves that ignite grass and trees in its surroundings.'),
    (126, 'black', 'When it breathes deeply, heat waves form around its body, making it hard to see clearly.'),
    (126, 'black-2', 'The scorching fire exhaled by Magmar forms heat waves around its body, making it hard to see the Pokémon clearly.'),
    (126, 'blue', 'Its body always burns with an orange glow that enables it to hide perfectly among flames.'),
    (126, 'brilliant-diamond', 'It was born in the crater of a volcano. Its body is covered with flames that shimmer like the sun.'),
