    (129, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Magikarp is virtually useless in battle as it can only splash around. As a result, it is considered to be weak. However, it is actually a very hardy Pokémon that can survive in any body of water no matter how polluted it is.'),
    (129, 'black', 'A Magikarp living for many years can leap a mountain using Splash. The move remains useless, though.'),
    (129, 'black-2', 'A Magikarp living for many years can leap a mountain using Splash. The move remains useless, though.'),
    (129, 'blue', 'In the distant past, it was somewhat stronger than the horribly weak descendants that exist today.'),
    (129, 'brilliant-diamond', 'It is said to be the world''s weakest Pokémon. No one knows why it has managed to survive.'),
