    (130, 'diamond', 'Once it appears, its rage never settles until it has razed the fields and mountains around it.'),
    (130, 'emerald', 'It is an extremely vicious and violent {{ScPkmn}}. When humans begin to fight, it will appear and burn everything to the ground with intensely hot flames.'),
