    (171, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Lanturn is known to emit light. If you peer down into the dark sea from a ship at night, you can sometimes see this Pokémon''s light rising from the depths where it swims. It gives the sea an appearance of a starlit night.'),
    (171, 'black', 'Lanturn''s light can shine up from great depths. It is nicknamed "The Deep-Sea Star."'),
    (171, 'black-2', 'Lanturn''s light can shine up from great depths. It is nicknamed "The Deep-Sea Star."'),
