    (173, 'alpha-sapphire', 'On nights with many shooting stars, Cleffa can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these Pokémon quench their thirst with the morning dew.'),
    (173, 'black', 'It is often seen when shooting stars fill the night skies. It''s said to arrive riding on a shooting star.'),
