    (174, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Igglybuff has a soft and plushy body that feels very much like a marshmallow. From this body wafts a gently sweet fragrance that soothes and calms the emotions of its foes.'),
    (174, 'black', 'It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop.'),
    (174, 'black-2', 'Its body has a faintly sweet scent and is bouncy and soft. If it bounces even once, it cannot stop.'),
    (174, 'brilliant-diamond', 'It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop.'),
    (174, 'crystal', 'Instead of walking with its short legs, it moves around by bouncing on its soft, tender body.'),
    (174, 'diamond', 'It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop.'),
    (174, 'emerald', 'Its soft and pliable body is very bouncy. When it sings continuously with all its might, its body steadily turns a deepening pink color.'),
