    (174, 'omega-ruby', 'Igglybuff''s vocal cords are not sufficiently developed. It would hurt its throat if it were to sing too much. This Pokémon gargles with freshwater from a clean stream.'),
    (174, 'pearl', 'It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop.'),
