    (174, 'scarlet', 'Its body has a faintly sweet scent and is bouncy and soft. If it bounces even once, it cannot stop.'),
    (174, 'shield', 'Taking advantage of the softness of its body, Igglybuff moves as if bouncing. Its body turns a deep pink when its temperature rises.'),
