    (185, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Sudowoodo camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because its hands remain green throughout the year, the Pokémon is easily identified as a fake during the winter.'),
    (185, 'black', 'To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain.'),
    (185, 'black-2', 'To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain.'),
    (185, 'brilliant-diamond', 'Though it looks like a tree, its body is actually more like rock or stone. The Pokémon is very weak to water.'),
