    (358, 'alpha-sapphire', 'In high winds, Chimecho cries as it hangs from a tree branch or the eaves of a building using a suction cup on its head. This Pokémon plucks berries with its long tail and eats them.'),
    (358, 'black', 'Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes.'),
    (358, 'black-2', 'Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes.'),
    (358, 'brilliant-diamond', 'To knock foes flying, it makes the air shudder with its cries. It converses using seven cries.'),
    (358, 'diamond', 'To knock foes flying, it makes the air shudder with its cries. It converses using seven cries.'),
    (358, 'emerald', 'They fly about very actively when the hot season arrives. They communicate among themselves using seven different and distinguishing cries.'),
    (358, 'firered', 'It travels by riding on winds. It cleverly uses its long tail to pluck nuts and berries, which it loves to eat.'),
