    (359, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Absol has the ability to foretell the coming of natural disasters. It lives in a harsh, rugged mountain environment. This Pokémon very rarely ventures down from the mountains.'),
    (359, 'black', 'Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.'),
    (359, 'black-2', 'It appears from deep in the mountains to warn people about upcoming disasters it has sensed with its horn.'),
    (359, 'diamond', 'It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.'),
    (359, 'emerald', 'It sharply senses even subtle changes in the sky and the land to predict natural disasters. It is a long-lived {{ScPkmn}} that has a life-span of 100 years.'),
    (359, 'firered', 'It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom-bringer.'),
    (359, 'heartgold', 'It has the ability to foretell natural disasters. Its life span is over a hundred years.'),
    (359, 'leafgreen', 'It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom-bringer.'),
    (359, 'moon', 'Although it''s said to bring disaster, in actuality, this Pokémon possesses a calm disposition and warns people of any crises that loom.'),
    (359, 'omega-ruby', 'Every time Absol appears before people, it is followed by a disaster such as an earthquake or a tidal wave. As a result, it came to be known as the disaster Pokémon.'),
    (359, 'pearl', 'It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.'),
    (359, 'platinum', 'Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.'),
    (359, 'ruby', 'Every time Absol appears before people, it is followed by a disaster such as an earthquake or a tidal wave. As a result, it came to be known as the disaster {{ScPkmn}}.'),
    (359, 'sapphire', 'Absol has the ability to foretell the coming of natural disasters. It lives in a harsh, rugged mountain environment. This {{ScPkmn}} very rarely ventures down from the mountains.'),
    (359, 'soulsilver', 'It has the ability to foretell natural disasters. Its life span is over a hundred years.'),
    (359, 'sun', 'Long ago, superstitions were spread about it, saying it brought disaster. This fed a hatred of it, and it was driven deep into the mountains.'),
    (359, 'ultra-moon', 'The elderly call it the disaster Pokémon and detest it, but interest in its power to predict disasters is on the rise.'),
    (359, 'ultra-sun', 'The only thing unlucky about Absol is its appearance. It protects fields and warns people of disaster, so one ought to be grateful for it.'),
    (359, 'white', 'Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.'),
    (359, 'white-2', 'It appears from deep in the mountains to warn people about upcoming disasters it has sensed with its horn.'),
