    (364, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Sealeo often balances and rolls things on the tip of its nose. While the Pokémon is rolling something, it checks the object''s aroma and texture to determine whether it likes the object or not.'),
    (364, 'black', 'It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.'),
    (364, 'black-2', 'Be it Spheal or Poké Ball, it will spin any round object on its nose with the greatest of ease.'),
    (364, 'brilliant-diamond', 'It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.'),
    (364, 'diamond', 'It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.'),
    (364, 'emerald', 'Sealeo live in herds on ice floes. Using its powerful flippers, it shatters ice. It dives into the sea to hunt prey five times a day.'),
    (364, 'firered', 'It touches new things with its nose to test for smell and feel. It plays by spinning Spheal on its nose.'),
    (364, 'heartgold', 'It has a very sensitive nose. It touches new things with its nose to examine them.'),
    (364, 'leafgreen', 'It touches new things with its nose to test for smell and feel. It plays by spinning Spheal on its nose.'),
    (364, 'legends-arceus', 'Its white whiskers are very sensitive. Sealeo will balance Spheal on the tip of its nose, checking its scent and its feel to be sure the Spheal is healthy.'),
    (364, 'omega-ruby', 'Sealeo has the habit of always juggling on the tip of its nose anything it sees for the first time. This Pokémon occasionally entertains itself by balancing and rolling a Spheal on its nose.'),
