    (422, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Its shape and coloration vary, depending on its habitat.'),
    (422, 'black', 'Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out.'),
    (422, 'black-2', 'Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out.'),
    (422, 'brilliant-diamond', 'Its colors and shapes differ from region to region. In the Sinnoh region, two types are confirmed.'),
