    (425, 'heartgold', 'It is whispered that any child who mistakes Drifloon for a balloon and holds on to it could wind up missing.'),
    (425, 'legends-arceus', 'Said to lure away young children and carry them off to the afterlife. Some whisper that Drifloon are formed of reincarnated human souls, but these rumors are as yet unconfirmed.'),
