    (426, 'alpha-sapphire', 'It''s drowsy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go.'),
    (426, 'black', 'At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.'),
    (426, 'black-2', 'They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can''t be a fixed destination.'),
