    (446, 'heartgold', 'It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing.'),
    (446, 'legends-arceus', 'Its robust stomach allows it to nonchalantly devour even rotted matter. It pays frequent visits to villages, seeking out food scraps intended for compost.'),
