    (448, 'black-2', 'By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away.'),
    (448, 'diamond', 'It has the ability to sense the [[aura]]s of all things. It understands [[human]] speech.'),
    (448, 'heartgold', 'It''s said that no foe can remain invisible to Lucario, since it can detect auras. Even foes it could not otherwise see.'),
    (448, 'moon', 'They can detect the species of a living being—and its emotions—from over half a mile away. They control auras and hunt their prey in packs.'),
