    (508, 'y', 'Being wrapped in its long fur is so comfortable that a person would be fine even overnight on a wintry mountain.'),
    (509, 'alpha-sapphire', 'They steal from people for fun, but their victims can''t help but forgive them. Their deceptively cute act is perfect.'),
