    (509, 'legends-za', 'Purrloin steals from people for fun, but its behavior is so charming that its victims can''t help but forgive it.'),
    (509, 'omega-ruby', 'Its cute act is a ruse. When victims let down their guard, they find their items taken. It attacks with sharp claws.'),
    (509, 'shield', 'Opponents that get drawn in by its adorable behavior come away with stinging scratches from its claws and stinging pride from its laughter.'),
