    (544, 'y', 'It is usually motionless, but when attacked, it rotates at high speed and then crashes into its opponent.'),
    (545, 'alpha-sapphire', 'With quick movements, it chases down its foes, attacking relentlessly with its horns until it prevails.'),
    (545, 'black', 'With quick movements, it chases down its foes, attacking relentlessly with its horns until it prevails.'),
    (545, 'black-2', 'It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison.'),
    (545, 'legends-za', 'It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until they stop moving. Then it finishes them off with deadly venom.'),
    (545, 'omega-ruby', 'It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison.'),
    (545, 'shield', 'Scolipede engage in fierce territorial battles with Centiskorch. At the end of one of these battles, the victor makes a meal of the loser.'),
    (545, 'sword', 'Scolipede latches on to its prey with the claws on its neck before slamming them into the ground and jabbing them with its claw''s toxic spikes.'),
    (545, 'white', 'Highly aggressive, it uses the claws near its neck to dig into its opponents and poison them.'),
    (545, 'white-2', 'It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison.'),
