    (554, 'y', 'When it sleeps, it pulls its limbs into its body and its internal fire goes down to 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit.'),
    (555, 'shield', 'This Pokémon''s power level rises along with the temperature of its fire, which can reach 2,500 degrees Fahrenheit.'),
    (555, 'sword', 'The thick arms of this hot-blooded Pokémon can deliver punches capable of obliterating a dump truck.'),
    (556, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Arid regions are their habitat. They move rhythmically, making a sound similar to maracas.'),
    (556, 'black', 'It uses an up-tempo song and dance to drive away the bird Pokémon that prey on its flower seeds.'),
    (556, 'black-2', 'When it moves rhythmically, it makes a sound similar to maracas, making the surprised Pokémon flee.'),
    (556, 'omega-ruby', 'It uses an up-tempo song and dance to drive away the bird Pokémon that prey on its flower seeds.'),
    (556, 'shield', 'Once each year, this Pokémon scatters its seeds. They''re jam-packed with nutrients, making them a precious food source out in the desert.'),
    (556, 'sword', 'With noises that could be mistaken for the rattles of maracas, it creates an upbeat rhythm, startling bird Pokémon and making them fly off in a hurry.'),
    (556, 'white', 'Arid regions are their habitat. They move rhythmically, making a sound similar to maracas.'),
