    (556, 'y', 'Arid regions are their habitat. They move rhythmically, making a sound similar to maracas.'),
    (557, 'alpha-sapphire', 'When it finds a stone of a suitable size, it secretes a liquid from its mouth to open up a hole to crawl into.'),
    (557, 'black', 'This Pokémon can easily melt holes in hard rocks with a liquid secreted from its mouth.'),
    (557, 'black-2', 'When it finds a stone of a suitable size, it secretes a liquid from its mouth to open up a hole to crawl into.'),
    (557, 'omega-ruby', 'It makes a hole in a suitable rock. If that rock breaks, the Pokémon remains agitated until it locates a replacement.'),
    (557, 'shield', 'It first tries to find a rock to live in, but if there are no suitable rocks to be found, Dwebble may move in to the ports of a Hippowdon.'),
    (557, 'sword', 'When it finds a stone appealing, it creates a hole inside it and uses it as its home. This Pokémon is the natural enemy of Roggenrola and Rolycoly.'),
    (557, 'white', 'It makes a hole in a suitable rock. If that rock breaks, the Pokémon remains agitated until it locates a replacement.'),
    (557, 'white-2', 'When it finds a stone of a suitable size, it secretes a liquid from its mouth to open up a hole to crawl into.'),
    (557, 'x', 'It makes a hole in a suitable rock. If that rock breaks, the Pokémon remains agitated until it locates a replacement.'),
    (557, 'y', 'When it finds a stone of a suitable size, it secretes a liquid from its mouth to open up a hole to crawl into.'),
    (558, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Competing for territory, Crustle fight viciously. The one whose boulder is broken is the loser of the battle.'),
    (558, 'black', 'Competing for territory, Crustle fight viciously. The one whose boulder is broken is the loser of the battle.'),
    (558, 'black-2', 'When its boulder is broken in battles for territory, it feels unsure and begins to weaken.'),
    (558, 'omega-ruby', 'It possesses legs of enormous strength, enabling it to carry heavy slabs for many days, even when crossing arid land.'),
    (558, 'shield', 'Its thick claws are its greatest weapons. They''re mighty enough to crack Rhyperior''s carapace.'),
    (558, 'sword', 'This highly territorial Pokémon prefers dry climates. It won''t come out of its boulder on rainy days.'),
    (558, 'white', 'It possesses legs of enormous strength, enabling it to carry heavy slabs for many days, even when crossing arid land.'),
