    (559, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too.'),
    (559, 'black', 'Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so it can reduce damage by defensively pulling its skin up to its neck.'),
    (559, 'black-2', 'Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too.'),
    (559, 'legends-za', 'Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so it can reduce damage by defensively pulling its skin up to its neck.'),
    (559, 'omega-ruby', 'Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so it can reduce damage by defensively pulling its skin up to its neck.'),
    (559, 'scarlet', 'It stretches its saggy skin up to its neck to protect itself. Among Scraggy, individuals with saggier skin apparently garner more respect.'),
    (559, 'shield', 'It protects itself with its durable skin. It''s thought that this Pokémon will evolve once its skin has completely stretched out.'),
    (559, 'sword', 'If it locks eyes with you, watch out! Nothing and no one is safe from the reckless headbutts of this troublesome Pokémon.'),
    (559, 'ultra-moon', 'It stretches its saggy skin up to its neck to protect itself. The saggier their skin, the more respect they garner.'),
    (559, 'ultra-sun', 'They move in small groups, walking around lazily. Anyone who makes eye contact gets smacked with a headbutt.'),
    (559, 'violet', 'It will abruptly headbutt anyone that makes eye contact with it. Its skull is extremely hard.'),
    (559, 'white', 'It immediately headbutts anyone that makes eye contact with it. Its skull is massively thick.'),
    (559, 'white-2', 'Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too.'),
