    (560, 'alpha-sapphire', 'It can smash concrete blocks with its kicking attacks. The one with the biggest crest is the group leader.'),
    (560, 'black', 'Groups of them beat up anything that enters their territory. Each can spit acidic liquid from its mouth.'),
