    (560, 'shield', 'While mostly known for having the temperament of an aggressive ruffian, this Pokémon takes very good care of its family, friends, and territory.'),
    (560, 'sword', 'As halfhearted as this Pokémon''s kicks may seem, they pack enough power to shatter Conkeldurr''s concrete pillars.'),
