    (561, 'omega-ruby', 'The guardians of an ancient city, they use their psychic power to attack enemies that invade their territory.'),
    (561, 'shield', 'A discovery was made in the desert where Sigilyph fly. The ruins of what may have been an ancient city were found beneath the sands.'),
    (561, 'sword', 'Psychic power allows these Pokémon to fly. Some say they were the guardians of an ancient city. Others say they were the guardians'' emissaries.'),
