    (572, 'y', 'These Pokémon prefer a tidy habitat. They are always sweeping and dusting, using their tails as brooms.'),
    (573, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Cinccino''s body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches.'),
    (573, 'black', 'Their white fur is coated in a special oil that makes it easy for them to deflect attacks.'),
    (573, 'black-2', 'Cinccino''s body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches.'),
    (573, 'omega-ruby', 'Their white fur feels amazing to touch. Their fur repels dust and prevents static electricity from building up.'),
    (573, 'scarlet', 'Their white fur is coated in a special oil that makes it easy for them to deflect attacks.'),
    (573, 'shield', 'A special oil that seeps through their fur helps them avoid attacks. The oil fetches a high price at market.'),
    (573, 'sword', 'Its body secretes oil that this Pokémon spreads over its nest as a coating to protect it from dust. Cinccino won''t tolerate even a speck of the stuff.'),
    (573, 'ultra-moon', 'The oil that seeps from its body is really smooth. For people troubled by bad skin, this oil is an effective treatment.'),
    (573, 'ultra-sun', 'The white parts of its coat are covered in an oil secreted from its body, so this Pokémon can slide right away from its enemies'' attacks.'),
    (573, 'violet', 'The oil that seeps from its body is really smooth. For people troubled by bad skin, this oil is an effective treatment.'),
    (573, 'white', 'Their white fur feels amazing to touch. Their fur repels dust and prevents static electricity from building up.'),
    (573, 'white-2', 'Cinccino''s body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches.'),
    (573, 'x', 'Their white fur feels amazing to touch. Their fur repels dust and prevents static electricity from building up.'),
    (573, 'y', 'Cinccino''s body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches.'),
    (574, 'alpha-sapphire', 'They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see.'),
    (574, 'black', 'Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something.'),
    (574, 'black-2', 'It stares intently at everything. It can become so obsessed with watching that it doesn''t notice attacks.'),
    (574, 'omega-ruby', 'Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something.'),
    (574, 'scarlet', 'This Pokémon is normally very innocent. When it is staring at something invisible, it is unblinking and utterly silent.'),
    (574, 'shield', 'Even when nobody seems to be around, Gothita can still be heard making a muted cry. Many believe it''s speaking to something only it can see.'),
    (574, 'sword', 'Though they''re still only babies, there''s psychic power stored in their ribbonlike feelers, and sometimes they use that power to fight.'),
    (574, 'violet', 'Beware of touching the ribbon-shaped feelers that control its psychic power. Gothita will begin bawling if you do.'),
    (574, 'white', 'They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see.'),
    (574, 'white-2', 'It stares intently at everything. It can become so obsessed with watching that it doesn''t notice attacks.'),
    (574, 'x', 'Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something.'),
    (574, 'y', 'They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see.'),
    (575, 'alpha-sapphire', 'According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights.'),
    (575, 'black', 'They use hypnosis to control people and Pokémon. Tales of Gothorita leading people astray are told in every corner.'),
    (575, 'black-2', 'According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights.'),
    (575, 'omega-ruby', 'Starlight is the source of their power. At night, they mark star positions by using psychic power to float stones.'),
    (575, 'scarlet', 'This Pokémon will hypnotize children to put them to sleep before carrying them away. Be wary of nights when the starlight is bright.'),
    (575, 'shield', 'On nights when the stars shine, this Pokémon''s psychic power is at its strongest. It''s unknown just what link Gothorita has to the greater universe.'),
    (575, 'sword', 'It''s said that when stars shine in the night sky, this Pokémon will spirit away sleeping children. Some call it the Witch of Punishment.'),
    (575, 'violet', 'Using its psychic power, it arranges pebbles to form the shapes of constellations. Some people believe this Pokémon came from outer space.'),
    (575, 'white', 'Starlight is the source of their power. At night, they mark star positions by using psychic power to float stones.'),
    (575, 'white-2', 'According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights.'),
    (575, 'x', 'Starlight is the source of their power. At night, they mark star positions by using psychic power to float stones.'),
    (575, 'y', 'According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights.'),
    (576, 'alpha-sapphire', 'They can predict the future from the placement and movement of the stars. They can see Trainers'' life spans.'),
    (576, 'black', 'Starry skies thousands of light-years away are visible in the space distorted by their intense psychic power.'),
    (576, 'black-2', 'It can see the future from the movement of the stars. When it learns its Trainer''s life span, it cries in sadness.'),
    (576, 'omega-ruby', 'Starry skies thousands of light-years away are visible in the space distorted by their intense psychic power.'),
    (576, 'scarlet', 'Gothitelle unleashes psychic energy and shows opponents dreams of the universe’s end. These dreams are apparently ethereal and beautiful.'),
    (576, 'shield', 'A criminal who was shown his fate by a Gothitelle went missing that same day and was never seen again.'),
    (576, 'sword', 'It has tremendous psychic power, but it dislikes conflict. It''s also able to predict the future based on the movement of the stars.'),
    (576, 'violet', 'It gazes at the stars to predict the future. It acts somewhat detached because it has seen the end of all existence.'),
    (576, 'white', 'They can predict the future from the placement and movement of the stars. They can see Trainers'' life spans.'),
    (576, 'white-2', 'It can see the future from the movement of the stars. When it learns its Trainer''s life span, it cries in sadness.'),
    (576, 'x', 'Starry skies thousands of light-years away are visible in the space distorted by their intense psychic power.'),
    (576, 'y', 'They can predict the future from the placement and movement of the stars. They can see Trainers'' life spans.'),
    (577, 'alpha-sapphire', 'They drive away attackers by unleashing psychic power. They can use telepathy to talk with others.'),
    (577, 'black', 'They drive away attackers by unleashing psychic power. They can use telepathy to talk with others.'),
    (577, 'black-2', 'Because their bodies are enveloped in a special liquid, they are fine in any environment, no matter how severe.'),
