    (580, 'alpha-sapphire', 'They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater.'),
    (580, 'black', 'These bird Pokémon are excellent divers. They swim around in the water eating their favorite food--peat moss.'),
    (580, 'black-2', 'They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater.'),
    (580, 'omega-ruby', 'When attacked, it uses its feathers to splash water, escaping under cover of the spray.'),
    (580, 'scarlet', 'It''s not very good at flying yet. It watches the dances of its Swanna parents to learn how to move its wings.'),
    (580, 'violet', 'It strengthens its body by diving in to the depths of ponds, swimming around while looking for bog moss to eat.'),
    (580, 'white', 'When attacked, it uses its feathers to splash water, escaping under cover of the spray.'),
