    (581, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Swanna start to dance at dusk. The one dancing in the middle is the leader of the flock.'),
    (581, 'black', 'Swanna start to dance at dusk. The one dancing in the middle is the leader of the flock.'),
    (581, 'black-2', 'Despite their elegant appearance, they can flap their wings strongly and fly for thousands of miles.'),
    (581, 'omega-ruby', 'Despite their elegant appearance, they can flap their wings strongly and fly for thousands of miles.'),
    (581, 'scarlet', 'Centered around its leader, the flock dances in perfect sync to strengthen its unity.'),
    (581, 'violet', 'It''s said that many artists have taken inspiration from the sight of Swanna performing a beautiful dance in the light of dawn.'),
    (581, 'white', 'It administers sharp, powerful pecks with its bill. It whips its long neck to deliver forceful repeated strikes.'),
