    (613, 'shield', 'It sniffles before performing a move, using its frosty snot to provide an icy element to any move that needs it.'),
    (613, 'sword', 'When this Pokémon is in good health, its snot becomes thicker and stickier. It will smear its snot on anyone it doesn''t like.'),
    (613, 'violet', 'When Cubchoo starts sneezing, watch out! If it spatters you with its frosty snot, you''ll get frostbite.'),
    (613, 'white', 'Its nose is always running. It sniffs the snot back up because the mucus provides the raw material for its moves.'),
    (613, 'white-2', 'Their snot is a barometer of health. When healthy, their snot is sticky and the power of their ice moves increases.'),
    (613, 'x', 'Its nose is always running. It sniffs the snot back up because the mucus provides the raw material for its moves.'),
    (613, 'y', 'Their snot is a barometer of health. When healthy, their snot is sticky and the power of their ice moves increases.'),
    (614, 'alpha-sapphire', 'It freezes its breath to create fangs and claws of ice to fight with. Cold northern areas are its habitat.'),
    (614, 'black', 'It can make its breath freeze at will. Very able in the water, it swims around in northern seas and catches prey.'),
    (614, 'black-2', 'They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath.'),
    (614, 'omega-ruby', 'They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath.'),
    (614, 'scarlet', 'It is a ferocious, carnivorous Pokémon. Once it captures its prey, it will breathe cold air onto the prey to freeze and preserve it.'),
    (614, 'shield', 'It swims energetically through frigid seas. When it gets tired, it freezes the seawater with its breath so it can rest on the ice.'),
    (614, 'sword', 'It swims through frigid seas, searching for prey. From its frozen breath, it forms icy fangs that are harder than steel.'),
    (614, 'violet', 'Feared as the Snow-White Demon in northern lands, Beartic uses its frosty claws and fangs to attack prey.'),
    (614, 'white', 'It freezes its breath to create fangs and claws of ice to fight with. Cold northern areas are its habitat.'),
    (614, 'white-2', 'They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath.'),
    (614, 'x', 'They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath.'),
    (614, 'y', 'It freezes its breath to create fangs and claws of ice to fight with. Cold northern areas are its habitat.'),
    (615, 'alpha-sapphire', 'They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148 degrees Fahrenheit.'),
    (615, 'black', 'When its body temperature goes up, it turns into steam and vanishes. When its temperature lowers, it returns to ice.'),
    (615, 'black-2', 'They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148° F.'),
    (615, 'legends-za', 'Cryogonal use chains made of ice crystals to ensnare prey. They freeze their victims at -148 degrees Fahrenheit.'),
    (615, 'omega-ruby', 'They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey.'),
    (615, 'scarlet', 'Cryogonal appear during cold seasons. It is said that people and Pokémon who die on snowy mountains are reborn into these Pokémon.'),
    (615, 'shield', 'When the weather gets hot, these Pokémon turn into water vapor. Cryogonal are almost never seen during summer.'),
    (615, 'sword', 'With its icy chains, Cryogonal freezes those it encounters. It then takes its victims away to somewhere unknown.'),
    (615, 'violet', 'Cryogonal uses its chains of ice to constrict its opponents and then flash-freezes them where they stand.'),
    (615, 'white', 'They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey.'),
    (615, 'white-2', 'They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148° F.'),
    (615, 'x', 'They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey.'),
    (615, 'y', 'They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148 degrees Fahrenheit.'),
    (616, 'alpha-sapphire', 'It evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown.'),
    (616, 'black', 'When attacked, it defends itself by closing the lid of its shell. It can spit a sticky, poisonous liquid.'),
    (616, 'black-2', 'When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve.'),
    (616, 'omega-ruby', 'When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve.'),
    (616, 'shield', 'It has a strange physiology that responds to electricity. When together with Karrablast, Shelmet evolves for some reason.'),
    (616, 'sword', 'When attacked, it tightly shuts the lid of its shell. This reaction fails to protect it from Karrablast, however, because they can still get into the shell.'),
    (616, 'white', 'It evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown.'),
    (616, 'white-2', 'When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve.'),
    (616, 'x', 'When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve.'),
    (616, 'y', 'It evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown.'),
    (617, 'alpha-sapphire', 'When its body dries out, it weakens. So, to prevent dehydration, it wraps itself in many layers of thin membrane.'),
    (617, 'black', 'When its body dries out, it weakens. So, to prevent dehydration, it wraps itself in many layers of thin membrane.'),
    (617, 'black-2', 'When its body dries out, it weakens. So it wraps a membrane around itself for protection while it spits poison.'),
    (617, 'omega-ruby', 'Having removed its heavy shell, it becomes very light and can fight with ninja-like movements.'),
    (617, 'shield', 'Discarding its shell made it nimble. To keep itself from dehydrating, it wraps its body in bands of membrane.'),
    (617, 'sword', 'It moves with blinding speed and lobs poison at foes. Featuring Accelgor as a main character is a surefire way to make a movie or comic popular.'),
    (617, 'white', 'Having removed its heavy shell, it becomes very light and can fight with ninja-like movements.'),
    (617, 'white-2', 'When its body dries out, it weakens. So it wraps a membrane around itself for protection while it spits poison.'),
    (617, 'x', 'Having removed its heavy shell, it becomes very light and can fight with ninja-like movements.'),
    (617, 'y', 'When its body dries out, it weakens. So, to prevent dehydration, it wraps itself in many layers of thin membrane.'),
    (618, 'alpha-sapphire', 'It conceals itself in the mud of the seashore. Then it waits. When prey touch it, it delivers a jolt of electricity.'),
    (618, 'black', 'Its skin is very hard, so it is unhurt even if stepped on by sumo wrestlers. It smiles when transmitting electricity.'),
    (618, 'black-2', 'When its opponent can''t be paralyzed, it contorts itself with unexpected speed and flops away.'),
    (618, 'omega-ruby', 'Its skin is very hard, so it is unhurt even if stepped on by sumo wrestlers. It smiles when transmitting electricity.'),
    (618, 'shield', 'For some reason, this Pokémon smiles slightly when it emits a strong electric current from the yellow markings on its body.'),
    (618, 'sword', 'Thanks to bacteria that lived in the mud flats with it, this Pokémon developed the organs it uses to generate electricity.'),
    (618, 'white', 'It conceals itself in the mud of the seashore. Then it waits. When prey touch it, it delivers a jolt of electricity.'),
    (618, 'white-2', 'When its opponent can''t be paralyzed, it contorts itself with unexpected speed and flops away.'),
    (618, 'x', 'Its skin is very hard, so it is unhurt even if stepped on by sumo wrestlers. It smiles when transmitting electricity.'),
    (618, 'y', 'It conceals itself in the mud of the seashore. Then it waits. When prey touch it, it delivers a jolt of electricity.'),
    (619, 'alpha-sapphire', 'In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies.'),
    (619, 'black', 'In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies.'),
    (619, 'black-2', 'It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity.'),
    (619, 'omega-ruby', 'It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity.'),
    (619, 'scarlet', 'In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies.'),
    (619, 'shield', 'Though small, Mienfoo''s temperament is fierce. Any creature that approaches Mienfoo carelessly will be greeted with a flurry of attacks.'),
    (619, 'sword', 'In one minute, a well-trained Mienfoo can chop with its arms more than 100 times.'),
    (619, 'ultra-moon', 'They seclude themselves in the mountains and devote themselves to training. The form of their kicks and chops differs from pack to pack.'),
    (619, 'ultra-sun', 'They can often be seen in packs in the morning, slowly moving their bodies through a series of poses.'),
    (619, 'violet', 'They seclude themselves in the mountains and devote themselves to training. The form of their kicks and chops differs from pack to pack.'),
    (619, 'white', 'They have mastered elegant combos. As they concentrate, their battle moves become swifter and more precise.'),
    (619, 'white-2', 'It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity.'),
    (619, 'x', 'It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity.'),
    (619, 'y', 'In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies.'),
    (620, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Using the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop.'),
    (620, 'black', 'It wields the fur on its arms like a whip. Its arm attacks come with such rapidity that they cannot even be seen.'),
    (620, 'black-2', 'Using the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop.'),
    (620, 'omega-ruby', 'It wields the fur on its arms like a whip. Its arm attacks come with such rapidity that they cannot even be seen.'),
    (620, 'scarlet', 'When Mienshao lets out a bizarre wail, you''re in danger. A flurry of kicks and chops too fast to see is about to be unleashed!'),
    (620, 'shield', 'Delivered at blinding speeds, kicks from this Pokémon can shatter massive boulders into tiny pieces.'),
    (620, 'sword', 'When Mienshao comes across a truly challenging opponent, it will lighten itself by biting off the fur on its arms.'),
    (620, 'ultra-moon', 'When Mienshao lets out a bizarre wail, you''re in danger. A flurry of kicks and chops too fast to see is about to be unleashed!'),
    (620, 'ultra-sun', 'It overwhelms its opponents with continuous attacks and then slowly stores up power before delivering the finishing blow.'),
    (620, 'violet', 'Using the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop.'),
    (620, 'white', 'They use the long fur on their arms as a whip to strike their opponents.'),
    (620, 'white-2', 'Using the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop.'),
    (620, 'x', 'It wields the fur on its arms like a whip. Its arm attacks come with such rapidity that they cannot even be seen.'),
