    (640, 'y', 'Legends say this Pokémon confounded opponents with its swift movements.'),
    (641, 'legends-arceus', 'This storm-stirring Pokémon is said to cause the seasons to turn by whipping up the air. I suspect its humanlike form to be a false one.'),
    (642, 'legends-arceus', 'They say this wielder of electricity has waged war with its nemesis, Tornadus, since time immemorial. The lightning bolts it hurls pierce the very earth and enrich the soil.'),
    (643, 'alpha-sapphire', 'When Reshiram''s tail flares, the heat energy moves the atmosphere and changes the world''s weather.'),
    (643, 'black', 'This {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} appears in [[Myths and legends involving Legendary and Mythical Pokémon|legends]]. It sends flames into the air from its tail, burning up everything around it.'),
    (643, 'black-2', 'This [[legendary Pokémon]] can scorch the {{pkmn|world}} with fire. It helps those who want to build a world of truth.'),
    (643, 'omega-ruby', 'This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with fire. It helps those who want to build a world of truth.'),
    (643, 'shield', 'According to myth, if people ignore truth and let themselves become consumed by greed, Reshiram will arrive to burn their kingdoms down.*'),
    (643, 'sword', 'Flames spew from its tail as it flies through the sky like a jet airplane. It''s said that this Pokémon will scorch the world.*'),
    (643, 'white', 'When Reshiram''s tail flares, the heat energy moves the atmosphere and changes the world''s weather.'),
    (643, 'white-2', 'This [[legendary Pokémon]] can scorch the {{pkmn|world}} with fire. It helps those who want to build a world of truth.'),
