    (643, 'y', 'When Reshiram''s tail flares, the heat energy moves the atmosphere and changes the world''s weather.'),
    (644, 'alpha-sapphire', 'Concealing itself in lightning clouds, it flies throughout the Unova region. It creates electricity in its tail.'),
    (644, 'black', 'Concealing itself in lightning clouds, it flies throughout the [[Unova]] [[region]]. It creates electricity in its tail.'),
    (644, 'black-2', 'This [[legendary Pokémon]] can scorch the {{pkmn|world}} with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world.'),
    (644, 'omega-ruby', 'This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world.'),
    (644, 'shield', 'Mythology tells us that if people lose the righteousness in their hearts, their kingdoms will be razed by Zekrom''s lightning.*'),
    (644, 'sword', 'When the interior part of its tail spins like a motor, Zekrom can generate many bolts of lightning to blast its surroundings.*'),
    (644, 'white', 'This {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} appears in [[Myths and legends involving Legendary and Mythical Pokémon|legends]]. In its tail, it has a giant generator that creates electricity.'),
    (644, 'white-2', 'This [[legendary Pokémon]] can scorch the {{pkmn|world}} with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world.'),
    (644, 'x', 'This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world.'),
    (644, 'y', 'Concealing itself in lightning clouds, it flies throughout the Unova region. It creates electricity in its tail.'),
    (645, 'legends-arceus', 'When the incarnations of wind and of lightning clash, Landorus arrives to quell the conflict. After the tempests and thunderbolts abate, the land is sure to be blessed with bountiful harvests.'),
    (646, 'alpha-sapphire', 'It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out.'),
    (646, 'black', 'It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out.'),
    (646, 'black-2', 'This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals.'),
    (646, 'omega-ruby', 'This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals.'),
    (646, 'shield', 'It appears that this Pokémon uses its powers over ice to freeze its own body in order to stabilize its cellular structure.*'),
    (646, 'sword', 'Dwelling within it is a power even greater than that of Reshiram or Zekrom, but the extreme cold keeps that power bound.*'),
    (646, 'white', 'It can produce ultracold air. Its body is frozen.'),
    (646, 'white-2', 'This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals.'),
    (646, 'x', 'This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals.'),
    (646, 'y', 'It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out.'),
    (647, 'legends-za', 'By shooting water from its hooves, Keldeo can travel across the water''s surface as if skating. It''s skilled at using kicking moves in battle.'),
    (647, 'shield', 'They say that Keldeo must survive harsh battles and fully develop the horn on its forehead before this Pokémon''s true power will awaken.*'),
    (647, 'sword', 'Cobalion, Terrakion, and Virizion taught this Pokémon how to fight. It dashes across the world, seeking more opportunities to further its training.*'),
    (648, 'legends-za', 'Sung using a special vocalization technique, Meloetta''s songs can manipulate the emotions of those who hear them.'),
    (649, 'alpha-sapphire', 'This Pokémon existed 300 million years ago. Team Plasma altered it and attached a cannon to its back.'),
    (649, 'black', 'Over 300 million years ago, it was feared as the strongest of hunters. It has been modified by Team Plasma.'),
    (649, 'black-2', 'This Pokémon existed 300 million years ago. Team Plasma altered it and attached a cannon to its back.'),
    (649, 'legends-za', 'Genesect is devoid of mercy. Its current form is equipped with a cassette loaded with ice energy.'),
    (649, 'legends-za', 'Genesect possesses sharp steel claws. Its current form is equipped with a cassette loaded with fire energy.'),
    (649, 'legends-za', 'Genesect fires off projectile energy blasts. Its current form is equipped with a cassette loaded with electric energy.'),
    (649, 'legends-za', 'Genesect assumes its flight configuration to soar through the sky. Its current form is equipped with a cassette loaded with water energy.'),
    (649, 'legends-za', 'This bug Pokémon of the Paleozoic era was revived by a certain organization, which also upgraded the cannon on Genesect''s back.'),
    (649, 'omega-ruby', 'This ancient bug Pokémon was altered by Team Plasma. They upgraded the cannon on its back.'),
