    (13, 'legends-za', 'The user attacks with numerous blades of wind. This move has a heightened chance of landing a critical hit, but it takes some time to carry out.'),
    (14, 'legends-arceus', 'A frenetic dance to uplift the fighting spirit. This raises the user’s offensive stats.'),
